WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:16.489
I have five senses.

2
00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:21.136
I see with my eyes.

3
00:00:21.137 --> 00:00:25.816
I see the frog jumping.

4
00:00:25.817 --> 00:00:30.503
I hear with my ears.

5
00:00:30.504 --> 00:00:35.094
I hear the bird singing.

6
00:00:35.095 --> 00:00:39.614
I smell with my nose.

7
00:00:39.615 --> 00:00:44.410
The roses smell good.

8
00:00:44.411 --> 00:00:48.659
I taste with my tongue.

9
00:00:48.660 --> 00:00:53.677
The candy tastes sweet.

10
00:00:53.678 --> 00:01:00.880
I touch with my hands.

11
00:01:00.881 --> 00:01:07.407
The ice feels cold.

12
00:01:07.408 --> 00:01:15.996
Whatever I do, I use my five senses.
